Package: CATAcode
Title: Explore and Code Responses to Check-All-that-Apply Survey Items
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Kyle", family = "Nickodem", email = "kyle.nickodem@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
